<div id="home" class="page active">
  <div class="hero">
    <div class="hero-badge">🌐 Civic Asset Recovery Network</div>
    <h1>Find What's <span class="hl">Lost.</span><br/>Return What's <span class="hl">Found.</span></h1>
    <p>AI-powered matching connects lost items to their owners instantly — across your city, verified on the blockchain.</p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <button class="btn btn-danger" onclick="handleReportClick('lost')">🔴 Report Lost Item</button>
      <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="handleReportClick('found')">🟢 Report Found Item</button>
      <button class="btn btn-outline" onclick="goPage('map')">📍 View Live Map</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="stats">
    <div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-num" id="s1">0</div><div class="stat-label">Items Reported</div></div>
    <div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-num" id="s2">0</div><div class="stat-label">Matches Found</div></div>
    <div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-num" id="s3">0</div><div class="stat-label">Items Returned</div></div>
    <div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-num" id="s4">0%</div><div class="stat-label">Recovery Rate</div></div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">How It <span>Works</span></div>
  <div class="steps">
    <div class="step"><div class="step-num">1</div><div class="step-content"><div class="step-title">Report your item</div><div class="step-desc">Submit details and a photo of your lost or found item. The more details, the better the match.</div></div></div>
    <div class="step"><div class="step-num">2</div><div class="step-content"><div class="step-title">AI matching engine runs</div><div class="step-desc">Our multimodal AI compares image features, text descriptions, location & time to find the best matches.</div></div></div>
    <div class="step"><div class="step-num">3</div><div class="step-content"><div class="step-title">Secure claim with verification</div><div class="step-desc">Claimants answer item-specific questions only the true owner would know. Every step recorded on-chain.</div></div></div>
    <div class="step"><div class="step-num">4</div><div class="step-content"><div class="step-title">Route tracked to pickup point</div><div class="step-desc">The Live Map shows routes between the owner and finder — guiding both to the nearest civic drop point.</div></div></div>
  </div>

  <div class="divider"></div>
  <div class="section-title" style="margin-top:1.5rem">Recent <span>Activity</span></div>
  <div id="recentCards" class="cards-grid"></div>
</div>

<div id="browse" class="page">
  <div class="section-title">Browse <span>All Items</span></div>
  <div style="display:flex;gap:1rem;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:1.5rem;align-items:center">
    <input type="text" placeholder="Search by name, category…" id="searchInput" oninput="renderBrowse()" style="max-width:260px" />
    <select id="filterType" onchange="renderBrowse()" style="max-width:160px">
      <option value="">All Types</option>
      <option value="lost">Lost</option>
      <option value="found">Found</option>
      <option value="matched">Matched</option>
    </select>
    <select id="filterCat" onchange="renderBrowse()" style="max-width:180px">
      <option value="">All Categories</option>
      <option>Electronics</option>
      <option>Bags &amp; Wallets</option>
      <option>Keys</option>
      <option>Clothing</option>
      <option>Jewellery</option>
      <option>Documents</option>
      <option>Pets</option>
      <option>Other</option>
    </select>
  </div>
  <div class="tabs">
    <button class="tab active" onclick="setTab(this,'all')">All Items</button>
    <button class="tab" onclick="setTab(this,'high')">High Match</button>
    <button class="tab" onclick="setTab(this,'new')">Newly Added</button>
  </div>
  <div id="browseGrid" class="cards-grid"></div>
</div>

<div id="map-page" class="page">
  <div class="section-title">Live <span>Map</span> & Route Tracker</div>

  <div class="route-panel">
    <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:1rem;">
      <div style="flex:1;min-width:220px">
        <div style="font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--muted);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.5px;margin-bottom:6px">Select a matched pair to show route</div>
        <select id="matchPairSelect" onchange="loadMatchRoute()" style="font-size:14px;width:100%">
          <option value="">— Pick a verified match pair to track route —</option>
        </select>
      </div>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:0.5rem;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center">
        <div id="matchBadge" style="display:none"><div class="ai-badge"><div class="pulse"></div> Route Active</div></div>
        <button class="btn btn-outline" onclick="clearRoute()" style="font-size:13px;padding:8px 14px">Clear Route</button>
        <button class="btn btn-info" onclick="showAllPins()" style="font-size:13px;padding:8px 14px">Show All Pins</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div id="pairInfo" style="display:none">
      <div class="route-pair-cards" style="margin-top:1rem">
        <div class="route-item-card lost-card" id="routeLostCard">
          <div style="font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:var(--danger);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.5px;margin-bottom:6px">🔴 Lost Item Location</div>
          <div id="routeLostName" style="font-weight:600;font-size:14px"></div>
          <div id="routeLostLoc" style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:3px"></div>
          <div id="routeLostScore" style="margin-top:6px"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="route-arrow">⟷</div>
        <div class="route-item-card found-card" id="routeFoundCard">
          <div style="font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.5px;margin-bottom:6px">🟢 Found Item Location</div>
          <div id="routeFoundName" style="font-weight:600;font-size:14px"></div>
          <div id="routeFoundLoc" style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:3px"></div>
          <div id="routeFoundScore" style="margin-top:6px"></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="route-stat-row" id="routeStats"></div>

      <div style="margin-top:1rem">
