  </div>

  <div class="section-title" style="margin-bottom:1rem">Select a <span>Match Pair</span> to Analyze</div>
  <div style="display:flex; gap:1rem; flex-wrap:wrap; margin-bottom:1.5rem; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; width:100%;">
